  "question": {
    "text": "Four metal plates are arranged as shown in the figure. Capacitance between <math><mi>X</mi></math> and <math><mi>Y</mi></math> (<math><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo></math> Area of each plate, <math><mi>d</mi><mo>→</mo></math> distance between the plates) is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0079_b4147791eb99.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 129px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [
